                                                                    75 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics    75 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University. The inelastic scattering      75 1451
 thermal scattering law data for UO2 was developed using            75 1451
 ab initio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The LEAPR module         75 1451
 from the NJOY code system was used to produce File 7 MT=2 and 4    75 1451
 for U in UO2 and O in UO2. Modifications to the LEAPR module were  75 1451
 made to calculate the coherent elastic cross-section for UO2 [3].  75 1451
 Per convention, MAT=75 and ZA=175 are used for O in UO2.           75 1451
                                                                    75 1451
